From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:15:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] audio: run the outputs from hifi_pll on g12, sm1, sc2 and t7

The card outputs run from MPLLs for one or both rate families, and the
MPLLs run 19 to 23 ppm slow, so audio drifts against video. hifi_pll
makes both families exactly, but one PLL serves every output, so two
streams at different families cannot both run from it. The t7 hifi_pll
took its rate from a one-entry 48k table.
---
